# SMB acceptance: death + game-over route (G.1 + G.3).
#
# Start, then hold Right and never jump: Mario runs into the first
# goomba three times (deaths at ~441/1007/1573 on the NES reference,
# lives 02->01->00->FF), reaches GAME OVER (mode 03 at ~1782), returns
# to the title (~2205), and the attract demo starts (~3068). Regression
# data for the SMB stress target, recorded against the NES reference
# with FD_REF_ONLY.
80:start
220:right
